From: Abbas Rizvi <abbas.rizvi@nomadrail.com>
Subject: [TRIAG-8585] device.py — Bugs 4, 8 (firmware/config None guards)

File: lib/report/device.py

Bug 4  needs_firmware_update(): self.firmware may be None -> .endswith() crash.
Bug 8  needs_configuration_update(): self.config may be None -> .endswith() crash.

Both: short-circuit on a falsy value before calling .endswith().
---
--- a/lib/report/device.py
+++ b/lib/report/device.py
@@ Bug 4: needs_firmware_update None guard @@
-        return not self.firmware.endswith(self.target["firmware"])
+        return bool(self.firmware) and not self.firmware.endswith(self.target["firmware"])
@@ Bug 8: needs_configuration_update None guard @@
-        return not self.config.endswith(self.target["config"])
+        return bool(self.config) and not self.config.endswith(self.target["config"])
